<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The enquiry volume problem</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Study-abroad consultancies receive the same questions repeatedly: eligibility, costs, deadlines, intakes and documents. Counsellors answer them one by one, which delays replies to students with complex cases.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    An AI assistant takes the repeatable questions and leaves counsellors the cases that need judgement.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Accuracy and freshness</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Entry requirements, fees and visa rules change. An assistant is only as good as the information it reads, so each source needs an owner and a review date. When it is unsure, it should say so and route the student to a counsellor.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Never let it improvise on visa or eligibility rules.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Capturing the student profile</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    During the conversation the assistant can collect academic background, preferred countries, budget and timeline into a structured profile. The counsellor opens a case that is already half prepared.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Admizz Education reduced student-inquiry response time by 45% with an AI-native inquiry system, as described in its case study.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Language and channels</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Students and parents contact consultancies on mobile, often in Nepali, English or a mix. Test the assistant in the languages and channels your audience actually uses, including messaging apps.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Track response time, handoff rate and counsellor hours spent on repeat questions.
  </p>
</div>

